{"id":10000092,"name":"嘉明","enName":"Gaming","title":"骏猊頕首","element":"火","region":"璃月","rarity":4,"weapon":"双手剑","birthday":"12月22日","constellation":"醒狮座","description":"剑匣镖局的镖师，威水舞兽队的话事人。","affiliation":"剑匣镖局","cv":{"chinese":"谢莹","japanese":"小松昌平","english":"殷嘉乐","korean":"金润气"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000092-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000092-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/11-500/Gaming.zip","voicePackageEn":"Gaming","quoteCount":71,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"老板你好呀，我是和记厅的镖师，叫我嘉明就行，要运货吗你？请坐请坐，饮杯茶先，我帮你打包好货就可以排期出发咯！哦！如果是找我舞兽的话即刻可以出发！「威水舞兽队」我就是话事人，嘿嘿，失礼失礼。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_draw_appear_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1b/s5ewyl4q2kn7r2pibs68gt1xuhlqg8e.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·舞兽","desc":"咚咚锵，睁眼！咚咚咚咚锵，洗须！唔…不好不好，还要练多点先。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f2/k7fu7d4o52e2t6zzy4vsqb6e0uc2afb.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·走镖","desc":"水路山路陆路，走镖时什么路没走过啊我？放心啦，金牌镖师不是浪得虚名的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9a/7vzjmxqkalzl62qs9mx7n7sggo6r2ac.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·早茶","desc":"一盅两件，再加个白灼时蔬和生滚靓粥，嗯…正啊…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/48/g21egs8loi4e79exizp71mmitt3kwyz.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"下雨啦！收衫啦！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5a/0pm55u8m1pv1jri0r2wjm7nflj0pf6e.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"嗱嗱嗱，你听，坏人发誓天打雷劈啊！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a7/iqjuynt4idbao3inhyco0t9tb932ysi.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"啊——咦？为什么下不到我嘴里的？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3f/lntg1il5i67p5aa03jmzb46ddpb59p9.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"晒点太阳好啊，去去湿气。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f1/nle28zkjvl8ky2yg86vmotmisclfn22.mp3"},{"title":"在沙漠的时候…","desc":"这种地方买水喝肯定很贵吧？好在我自己带水了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_weather_desert_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e2/qxdkow5tt01evc7cbb272nmhwgpvwdk.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"我练完功了，准备去喝早茶，一起？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/23/mvvk4rwaq4cjcfuefvuckojlmcwffgc.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"虽然叫早茶，其实中午也能喝的，怎么说，走？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e6/3orlaktwo6lx1tdx2z4y9p1mpj50t9x.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"我定到一间菜馆，夜晚才开门，听说只做熟客生意的，来都来了，不吃就走宝了，出发？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/37/mbv4vtv5cjcpbdk94nwswo4uu5cuor6.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"要睡了吗？饿不饿啊？不如吃个宵夜先？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1e/1a979i32lk6ll2kao5e73z7r22gha5q.mp3"},{"title":"关于嘉明自己·老家","desc":"翘英庄，去过吗？我老家。我们那里茶叶很出名的，有「松萝仙芽」，还有「游韵单丛」。这样这样，择日不如撞日，我这里有盒靓单丛，我现在带去茶楼，给你泡一壶，走走走，我埋单！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1e/1oy77vak2z9miia6d3jjsd5v2sxgk81.mp3"},{"title":"关于嘉明自己·今时今日","desc":"我嘉明今时今日，有口饭吃，还能有时间精力钻研舞兽戏，真的要多谢周围好多人的理解和提携。将心比心，我肯定会打醒十二分精神做好这份工。还有余力，就多跑跑腿啊、请人饮茶啊，又不会少块肉咯，哈哈。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b3/bhspru64ysg92dlvm5mrmfa3vxosmoj.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·赏脸","desc":"不用运货的时候我一般在璃月港路边表演舞兽戏，赏个脸来看看？不要钱的不要钱的，只要街坊朋友看得开心我就很满足啦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f8/nn2qd7coahzz97wnd3naduqdi6es825.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·得闲饮茶","desc":"记住啊，出门靠朋友，有什么困难不要硬顶喔你，需要我帮手随时出声！欸，大吉利是！最好就别听到你有难的消息啦，出门在外，最紧要是平平安安顺顺利利，我更希望听到你约我得闲饮茶咯。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fc/50a2fsu6zzzhwl3io6n2lm0ps28wvuf.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"武侠小说有写，打通任督二脉之后就会变成武林高手，拿到神之眼的瞬间就是这种感觉…哈哈，讲笑而已！我不是什么武林高手，不过是多了点精力，那就顺手帮衬下街坊咯。不过讲开又讲，你没有神之眼都这么厉害，有了还得了？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_dialog_pendant_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/ba/af1wjvw41ayyvcdsohtc5pcp5fj757v.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"「文仔」好调皮的，本来咧，我想他文静一点才起的这个名，呃…如你所见，好像没什么用哈哈。不过也好，生生猛猛才能将舞兽戏做得风生水起嘛。看着文仔，我也慢慢能模仿出猊兽的神态动作，一戴上兽首，感觉就来了喂，吼！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1e/bpu2grlzb8jf9umk10tacc5i9dw5pus.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"有很多花花草草，或者树皮树枝，晒干后用来煲水喝，生津解渴，清热降燥，好有益的！我阿婆阿婶都跟我讲过，吃煎炸食物前后，一定要记得喝这种「凉茶」，清清体内的热气喔。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_pref_gift_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/df/9c5iiv2zncapeeordblgge312tam8ko.mp3"},{"title":"关于香菱…","desc":"香菱大师傅有好多拿手菜，我最喜欢那味水煮黑背鲈，虽然每次都用水涮了两次先吃，还是辣得我「嘶哈嘶哈」，哈哈哈，不愧是万民堂的生招牌，用料真足火候真猛！下次我还吃！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_teammate_xiangling_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b3/1bggx4jyncod5tcma4jar43p25f8xvi.mp3"},{"title":"关于行秋…","desc":"飞云商会是镖局的老主顾了，印象中一直都是他们的大少爷在打理生意上的事情，有次行秋少爷难得主动问起镖物的事，我就一五一十地将飞云商会最近货物的路线和收发日子告诉他，结果他问的是能不能透露一下万文集舍最新那批货什么时候到，哈哈哈。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_teammate_xingqiu_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/50/6c0n3hvgouqugdjjaht70q3mkfanuew.mp3"},{"title":"关于重云…","desc":"听说那位仁兄有「纯阳之体」，按照我们那边的说法，他体内可能虚火很旺啊，应该多喝点凉茶喔他。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_teammate_chongyun_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f6/gigh8bpaz5cfspd77daclg8m59n14ny.mp3"},{"title":"关于刻晴…","desc":"多得玉衡星大人，她带头整治完遗珑埠跟璃月港之间的运输路段之后，盗贼都不敢那么猖獗了。我会不会失业？哈哈，那又未必，就算不用跟贼人打架了，担担抬抬这种粗重工夫总要有人干的嘛。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_teammate_keqing_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5a/bl11wxsizjqygux0ywzsnyrct1dlp3o.mp3"},{"title":"关于白术…","desc":"走镖也好舞兽也好，跌打损伤都是家常便饭。好在有白大夫，他配的药真是舟车劳顿、居家旅行的必备良药，镖局的兄弟们都托我来璃月港的时候帮手带点回去的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_teammate_baizhu_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/27/2omxajdf7mvgs75d6enru8qt5pvhon6.mp3"},{"title":"关于七七…","desc":"七七小妹妹非常热心，见我每次来不卜庐都抓很多药，觉得我是因为身体僵硬才会摔跤受伤，所以教我做了柔软体操，哈哈，好简单的，你也试试？来，一二七七…二二七七…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_teammate_qiqi_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d3/718xsnrm2x5aqlvkn19f45kfzsoio52.mp3"},{"title":"关于云堇…","desc":"云堇大师是我榜样啊！不管内行外行，听过她的曲的都说好。真是不得了，什么时候「威水队」能做到「云翰社」一半的影响力…我做梦都会笑醒！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_teammate_yunjin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/30/3pd2pxig12wlibfucpvlvgsovr06oqz.mp3"},{"title":"关于辛焱…","desc":"辛焱的演唱实在是太有感染力了！文仔听的时候也一直摇头晃脑的，喜欢得不得了！有机会的话真想请她一起办一个「火爆摇滚舞兽会」，你见识多，你觉得有没有搞头？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_teammate_xinyan_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0a/gaenaxn7cckhe7hxlvpfaioreyd1gmy.mp3"},{"title":"关于闲云…","desc":"闲云姨很关照我，见我的兽首磨损了，马上说要做十个八个比我人还高的兽首给我，我讲到口水都干了，她才同意在我原来这个上改良…现在我这个兽首，又威武又轻便，兽披随时随地都能飘起来，就像有仙风托住一样！我超喜欢！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_teammate_xianyun_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8d/0hagqjg6vp1rx4qfzrd4mpjfd644bg9.mp3"},{"title":"关于钟离…","desc":"我猜那位钟离先生一定是位出身富贵的文人雅士。不管我运货到茶馆还是戏台，都能撞见他在喝茶听书，一看就懂很多的样子。哇，有次无意中听到他跟别人讲茶，当时我就觉得他跟我老爸肯定可以讲通宵了…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_teammate_zhongli_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/54/0pexbqo62xo7c5a05r1ix3sxnhctw8r.mp3"},{"title":"关于夏洛蒂…","desc":"哦，那位记者小姐啊嘛！我知道她！遗珑埠的枫丹人都喜欢看蒸汽鸟报，我也经常蹭着看看，有很多不得了的新闻都是她写的喔！哦！我记得你还上过头条啊！是不是？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_teammate_charlotte_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7b/kkmav4xjv6splsfgxaxxwvgtan2qpkr.mp3"},{"title":"关于蓝砚…","desc":"认识她，你有食神啦！你让蓝砚带你去山里吃农家菜，点名要去可以自带食材加工的农庄，你说是嘉明指定那家，她就知道了。那条山路特别难走，没有她这样有经验的本地人带路，我怕你走到天黑都找不到。你们尽管去吃，报我名字就行，老板认识我的，吃完入我数！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_teammate_lanyan_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/01/56s0e8ltovnn4ee7x11j7t2nfavzfiw.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解嘉明·其一","desc":"镖师里最会舞兽的，舞兽师傅里运过最多镖的，怎么样？这样介绍不知道能不能让你记住我咧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/44/7cotw0i8x2vwrqkwv9dps4iowhc53z8.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解嘉明·其二","desc":"是不是三脚猫功夫看基本功就知道了，扎马、踢腿、劈叉、弹跳、翻滚…连这些都半桶水，轻则从高桩上跌下来，躺他个一头半个月。重则运镖打不过人，失镖丧命…吓不吓人？吓人就对了嘛，当初我就是这样说服镖局的兄弟每日同我一起练功的，哈哈哈。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f3/t1vqeteomv0wx7ftgzg3mjh0163s3kj.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解嘉明·其三","desc":"兽首兽披啊、锣鼓钹镲啊，练得多了旧得也快，要勤力点养护，这里面得花不少钱呢。再加上平时请人吃饭喝茶、过时过节送送礼、兄弟们周转不灵借点钱…七七八八加起来，一个月走镖赚的钱就没几多剩了…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/41/0j0dvbl93x6ygz4e03yxcqac5el5lwk.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解嘉明·其四","desc":"老爸一直想我跟他学做生意，不是没想过啊我，正是因为想清楚了才离家出走的。一来要证明给他看，我舞兽不是三分钟热度，一定会出人头地！二来嘛，也可以跟老爸少打点仗…两父子哪有隔夜仇的，我不是恨他，只是他每次开口火药味都很重，我避得到就避咯。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9e/0jjldamxir7yjvwaorkcal8l4wp9lct.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解嘉明·其五","desc":"嗱，这里，前两日练踢腿，淤了一片…这个包，上个月练翻滚的时候撞的，已经快好咯~这个疤就厉害了，是我第一次上高桩时摔下来弄的，那时流了好多好多血，差点以为我的舞兽生涯刚刚开始就要结束了…不过好彩，这么多年来都是有惊无险，我还能继续…嗯，一定要继续。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b3/tkhlvkxopzblyjdch21wzhtkjcaexfs.mp3"},{"title":"嘉明的爱好…","desc":"早茶不只有茶啦，还有各种甜点咸点，有即点即上的也有现点现做的，每次喝完早茶我都不用吃午饭了。你得闲就叫我，我请你饮茶！想吃什么就点什么，没所谓的吃不完打包回去嘛。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5e/04yntenw5z4q7g5qjy3vox84x61qsd1.mp3"},{"title":"嘉明的烦恼…","desc":"什么？！茶位费就算了，擦手帕都要另外收钱的？好在我自己有带，退掉退掉。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_dialog_annoyed_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/76/28axc82p61qsdx2c7pz3k0pxjm9mm4f.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"小时候很顽皮的我，还记得每次闯祸后我不听教，我老妈都会气得骂一句「生块叉烧好过生你」，现在每次吃叉烧，还挺想老妈的…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0c/8rnrrjce0j46xj6sepkssg785atn5ps.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"他们总说我口味刁钻，我的要求很简单啊——禽肉有禽肉味，鱼肉有鱼肉味，很过分吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6d/l6i2jkp60433uig3i715w3l99kxuurr.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"这个味道——难道阁下的真实身份就是「神」？没说错吧？「厨神」阁下。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c0/ejwwwf336kwyx6xouhhxquzvtx09m06.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"你亲手做的？有心了有心了！这样的烹饪水平，摆到明是高手啦！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4d/5rr8ko6ssekapod8pow9s9twy4t3pcg.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"错就要认，打就要立正！如果我哪里行差踏错了不如你还是直接打我一顿吧！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/89/gq1hzis6az8e4ykwbwjlwznfdrgc51h.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"不是吧你，生日这么好的日子都不提前告诉我？好在我已经在新月轩订好一桌子菜啦，八菜一汤白饭任装，还有寿包和糖水，叫多点朋友一起来贺一贺呀。另外咧，我还准备了一小段祝寿舞兽戏，小小意思，不成敬意，希望你钟意啦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c5/ksp8cttijslmm9ud1vv6eozxznc8muy.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"哇，这些都给我了？这么大手笔，怎么好意思啊？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cb/gihwzs0xfbohcc4wkyguqh37m8hndee.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"哈哈，真看得起我啊，那我不练个砂煲那么大的拳头有点对不住你喔。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0c/8nnoq7z9qm2xj686m660rff03z69jhb.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"走镖也是镖，保镖也是镖，信得过我的话，以后我来当你保镖咯？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f0/stqt4s1wkwo46itl8nnia36wdiqndha.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"多谢你为我的兽首点睛，接下来的旅途，不敢说包你顺风顺水，但我一定会落力豁出去，帮你采青！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2e/9re72dfp1tc7jt02kelxj3owboy5a70.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"对不住咯。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/64/d2ulu686x3wkkamolk8hqzyvqnnkxrg.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"采青先！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d0/mgefyfe7gbdn48dzfwj02upthgypk81.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"中头奖啦！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b5/6l035483wmyfx97o1asoolsh6339u4l.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"鸿运当头。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/76/h1iso0h8kxtut59fnyhv1wuw4s7wb78.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"文仔，到你出马！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c7/tusvkhzrttq69hkrq1vc12qzmrot0zo.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"威水舞兽！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/41/lzse0zi61tsrwlhq1ngfrbc88kdn59u.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"哇，好靓喔这批货！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4f/itcdfnz50ch8cut3g13kut90j7e5xc4.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"这趟镖要运去哪呢老板？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7f/opz3p3sub0cgo63tms02dwh7r5ojo38.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"淡淡定定，有财进。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/db/1e92xsis12ieils1mqyqwnlhwcyga00.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"小小痛楚等于激励…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/85/qrjqx337p9l965qo44lmrpc2p2hyx7g.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"呵，小意思啦…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/31/t5vyo35r3zc8ktjkg97o2qsaneakcbv.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"顶得住！继续！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/27/kr6xx897v5sow183gofcy4rdjy7wgwi.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"歇一阵先，包在我身上！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0e/irus16pm9rlvo0x2fw86z0xvwygjs90.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"喂！不要硬顶啊！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a2/kdo9ztb9p0balnmz72oigccvwn4w9kr.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"呵，我走先啦…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6a/myttq6xwqubig73rpuslodzus5uml0y.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"还没「采青」呢…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/62/k9qgx1zookw0frigfkvdtc1qar9qkov.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"快点走…不用理我…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6c/tltsu3aaj7pp8bwdyvt3oalkngqbhc6.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"不是吧你！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6f/g1e6uxti6zjka3dcz7hzyu15tx3w9s9.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其二","desc":"停手！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_gaming/vo_gaming_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0c/7kcvi3lj3f6b9bsdj9wsens1t6ax8eh.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"走镖去喽。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_gaming_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6b/18uyn8vssc8ha40ec1fkrjxomqj2kom.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"收到，开桩！","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_gaming_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/92/hu638d1cmyi9w9hvdl6136h3avvgfe7.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"急吗？不急喝个早茶先？","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_gaming_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/00/396o1jrjlks09o12es2svxfdhgie3de.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000092-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000092-full.webp","fullArtWidth":924,"fullArtHeight":968}